{
  "description": "a v3 multipart response body compared part by part (ADR 0040): a regex reaches a field's text, an integer and a type rule under a JSON file's part name reach its document, and a regex an XML file's attribute; the reply's parts come in another order, under its own boundary and file names, with a member and a part the pact does not have, which a response may",
  "input": {
